**

!.dockerignore
!mcp-local/
!mcp-local/Dockerfile
!mcp-local/server.py
!mcp-local/sql/
!mcp-local/sql/**
!mcp-local/utils/
!mcp-local/utils/**
!arm_kb_search/
!arm_kb_search/**
!arm-mcp-definitions/
!arm-mcp-definitions/arm_mcp_definitions/
!arm-mcp-definitions/arm_mcp_definitions/*.py
!arm-mcp-definitions/arm_mcp_definitions/skills/
!arm-mcp-definitions/arm_mcp_definitions/skills/**
!mcp-local/uv.lock

# Exclude Python bytecode caches re-included by the recursive directory allow rules above.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
